d_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-03-25T15:46:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T16:49:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.5.stable onward\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.7.dev2\n- Not reproducible in Godot v4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8108) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads) - 63.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n| Renderer | Godot 4.4.1 | Godot 4.5\n--|--|--\nForward+ | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82d1a8d0-e768-456b-89d0-f19bed19ea27\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/440c7147-a485-4b2f-8111-262b5ca0ba8e\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c81c978e-ac4b-4604-a0f3-3168cc39e04f\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ded7996b-579f-4df8-acc5-8c769a86fa60\" />\nCompatibility |<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3fd5a65-c3ce-44c7-a840-100801f7eb0a\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f90e329-3464-49cf-b728-cd6d0444e364\" />\n\n*Note: glitches in top right corner of Mobile are resolved in later versions of Godot.*\n\nI've assigned the \"bug\" label, but not sure yet if this is due to a limitation in the Mobile and Compatibility renderers or if it's something else. It happens the same with HDR 2D enabled or disabled in the latest dev release and earlier.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a scene with a panorama sky with a gradient that has only one colour\n- Create an object that is fully metalic\n- Note that reflection is different between Forward+ and Compatibility/Mobile\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[dark-reflection-colour.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26247867/dark-reflection-colour.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117833/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}